        card("Noun + linker + adjective (Activity 1)", "Convert the adjective + linker + noun phrases to noun + linker + adjective. The book’s answers keep the original word order of the linked words in a few cases that are unusual in real speech (kesong puti and kaning itim are normally said as is); the regular conversions are:", tables=[table(["Adjective + linker + noun", "Noun + linker + adjective"], [list(r) for r in _ACT1S], say=[0, 1])]),
